From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Erfan Abdi <erfangplus@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 16/25] apklayer: android-get-device-api-level

android_get_device_api_level in libc.so: Go's cgo runtime (WireGuard, Rethink DNS) looks it up with dlsym on libc.so; its presence selects the Android Q path that uses the free TLS_SLOT_APP (slot 2, which bridge/native/bionic_tls.c keeps at tp+16) instead of scanning pthread keys for a slot, which finds nothing here.

apklayer patch: step 11 of the former scripts/patch-bionic-translation.sh (see docs/PATCHES.md), patch 0016 of patches/bionic_translation.
---
 libc/libc-misc.c | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/libc/libc-misc.c b/libc/libc-misc.c
index ba67c36..43895cc 100644
--- a/libc/libc-misc.c
+++ b/libc/libc-misc.c
@@ -68,3 +68,9 @@ char* bionic___gnu_strerror_r(int error_number, char* buf, size_t buf_len) {
 	return buf;
 #endif
 }
+
+/* apklayer patch: see docs/PATCHES.md */
+int bionic_android_get_device_api_level(void)
+{
+	return 36;
+}
